  = must: confirm future runtime module inventory, accepted fixture source paths, expected trace ledger paths, proof ledger paths, generated trace roots, dependency boundary, adapter boundary, dispatch boundary, operations boundary, live-control deferral boundary, command plan, and proof gates
  = must: preserve graph checkpoint nonauthority, deterministic transition, SOP interrupt handoff, generated trace nonpromotion, no-assignment, no-dispatch, no-operations-control, and no-live-effect semantics without creating runtime code in this slice
  = must: keep dependency installation, package metadata mutation, external LangGraph adapter work, transport, UI, assignment, dispatch, operations control, and live machine control gated until a later accepted slice explicitly opens a bounded path
  - never: create runtime code, generated traces, proof runner code, tests, dependency changes, package metadata changes, adapters, transports, UI, assignment records, dispatch records, command execution beyond validation commands, process control, GPU control, model runtime control, credential access, network mutation, destructive filesystem action, operations control, or live machine control in this slice

